{"src":"en","tgt":"zh","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"zh","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7964.1131430000005,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8573.666664,"text":"然而，深圳特区在这方面在某种程度上像一个国家一样运作。"},{"kind":"audio","t":8694.620351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8699.329408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8704.587866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8709.847633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8715.845089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":8716.817934,"samples":16160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15115.939887,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15722.986477999999,"text":"这座洞穴位于麦加北部的其中一座山顶，紧邻"},{"kind":"audio","t":15829.099347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15831.282893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15836.653629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":15839.013952000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"audio","t":15839.354976999999,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17742.109661,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18000.390659,"text":"与世隔绝。"},{"kind":"audio","t":18095.725208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18096.765371,"samples":28432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":26292.568839,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":26981.081234,"text":"如今人们在电脑屏幕上写字，再也不需要靠近削笔刀。"},{"kind":"audio","t":27087.115465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27093.912579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27099.417443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27104.617931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":27105.110564,"samples":24928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37546.323485,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":38588.741092,"text":"前往税率较高国家的旅行者有时可以节省相当จำนวน的钱，尤其是在购买酒精饮料和烟草等产品时。"},{"kind":"audio","t":38720.494511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38725.81314699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38731.098475000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38736.52978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38741.619699999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38746.960355999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38752.230274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":38752.619988000006,"samples":25024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45791.173603999996,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46282.253939999995,"text":"植物通过光合作用利用阳光制造养分。它们还能提供遮荫。"},{"kind":"audio","t":46401.575102999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46406.95303800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46412.225746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":46417.870868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46420.020974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"audio","t":46420.314769000004,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":58072.617677,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":58913.629057,"text":"医院遵循了感染控制方案，包括将患者与他人隔离，以防止可能造成他人感染。"},{"kind":"audio","t":59037.865162999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59040.967464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":59044.234193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59048.90448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59052.170859000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59054.722139000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":59055.129632,"samples":13992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68181.26396099999,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69121.669035,"text":"所做的工作大部分是理论性的，但编写该程序是为了模拟对人马座星系所做的观测。"},{"kind":"audio","t":69247.514696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69252.762234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69258.26239799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69263.9062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69270.848801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69276.078469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69276.6612,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":78310.70164,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79340.17996,"text":"巴塞罗那的官方语言是加泰罗尼亚语和西班牙语。大约一半的人倾向于说加泰罗尼亚语，绝大多数人能听懂，几乎所有人都懂西班牙语。"},{"kind":"audio","t":79511.549779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79516.740768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79522.114473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79527.42799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79532.753967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79537.985945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79543.05249599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79546.48660199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79549.81337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79550.68652599999,"samples":32688,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":83795.315164,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84633.99583,"text":"在某些地区，水烧开一分钟就足够了，而在其他地区则需要几分钟。"},{"kind":"audio","t":84754.436655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84759.86669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84765.309465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":84770.847618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84776.17223499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84777.288617,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":89859.216043,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90805.585243,"text":"植物在自然环境下状态最好，因此请抵制诱惑，哪怕只是一根茎也不要采摘。"},{"kind":"audio","t":90922.000491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90927.888609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90933.172387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90938.55461199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90944.016617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90947.31945499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"audio","t":90947.589391,"samples":7992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97275.087475,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98151.17313699999,"text":"在20世纪20年代，大多数公民和国家的普遍态度是和平主义和孤立主义。"},{"kind":"audio","t":98267.17743499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98272.711507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98278.251049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98283.59849399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":98288.89454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98292.925026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":98293.199581,"samples":13392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103532.405942,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104408.2419,"text":"Masa Serif 是那个时代的顶级掠食者，所以除了其他 Mosul，它无所畏惧。"},{"kind":"audio","t":104529.643941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104534.98047699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104540.36257099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104545.57588799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104550.066947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":104550.377972,"samples":15560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113144.879496,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114301.32564699999,"text":"自1537年亚松森建立以来，巴拉圭成功地保留了大量其原住民的特色和认同感。"},{"kind":"audio","t":114426.114105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114431.77428499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114437.12960999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114442.614083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114448.337642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114453.600188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":114453.736616,"samples":23592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119873.37591,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120470.883539,"text":"这种疾病由猪携带，随后通过蚊子传播给人类。"},{"kind":"audio","t":120577.621394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120584.007692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120590.19697399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120594.56997499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":120594.84317,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129360.649934,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130126.068066,"text":"大多数现代研究望远镜都是位于大气条件有利的偏远地区的大型设施。"},{"kind":"audio","t":130237.634174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130243.015018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":130248.27191499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130253.77392800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130259.046584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130260.917354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"audio","t":130261.19537,"samples":792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":135229.790078,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":135920.012445,"text":"人们可能没有预料到，耐心和理解对于旅行者来说也是必要的。"},{"kind":"audio","t":136036.706091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136042.242133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136047.954792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136053.498524,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":136056.258761,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"audio","t":136056.525976,"samples":5360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140541.240181,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141090.010004,"text":"因此，这个符号很可能只是作为一个标签而添加的。"},{"kind":"audio","t":141196.175538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141201.60615099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141207.02413499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141212.38725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":141212.898302,"samples":19528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147770.420002,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148284.651844,"text":"但鸟类身上仍有很多地方看起来像恐龙。"},{"kind":"audio","t":148386.389068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148388.283128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148390.41682399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148390.903196,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":154959.722866,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155753.25962199998,"text":"它们几乎全是适合安全游泳的沙滩，而且大多数都提供了由……提供的遮荫处"},{"kind":"audio","t":155867.462908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155872.579516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155878.04765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155883.322866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155888.72285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155891.450377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"audio","t":155891.587425,"samples":5592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":157894.199905,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158167.167919,"text":"波希坎树。"},{"kind":"audio","t":158260.405408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158261.352863,"samples":27232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":164335.723337,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165512.076192,"text":"杜瓦尔已婚并有两个成年子女，他给米勒留下的印象并不深刻，而这个故事正是讲述给米勒听的。"},{"kind":"audio","t":165633.837248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165639.35712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165644.96859099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165650.309396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165655.847548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165661.308972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165666.051646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":165666.175984,"samples":17224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":175706.098159,"code":1005}]}